    <panel_attributes>title=SD06 Suggest difficulty and create a mixed quiz
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=QuizService~s
obj=ProgressTracker~t
obj=QuizRepository~r
obj=RetrievalStrategy~x
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ResponseParser~p
obj=QuestionCreator~c

u-&gt;f : suggestDifficulty(courseId, topic)
f-&gt;s : suggestDifficulty(courseId, topic)
s-&gt;t : getAccuracy(courseId, topic), getGradedCount(courseId, topic)
t.&gt;s : concept accuracy and graded count
s-&gt;r : listQuizzes(courseId)
r.&gt;s : saved quizzes
combinedFragment=opt~topics s r; r:[A saved quiz topic matches]
s-&gt;r : listAttempts(courseId)
r.&gt;s : saved attempts
s:Aggregate GRADED results from submitted matching attempts
--
s:Use the larger graded sample, preferring the quiz-topic sample on a tie
s.&gt;f : level, sample count, accuracy and reason
f.&gt;u : difficulty suggestion
u-&gt;f : createQuiz(courseId, topic, count, difficulty, types)
f-&gt;s : createQuiz(course, topic, count, difficulty, types)
s:Validate inputs
s-&gt;x : retrieve(topic, chunks, 5)
x.&gt;s : relevant chunks or empty list
s:An empty match returns an error before a model call
combinedFragment=loop~draft s c; l:[At most three proposals while questions are missing]
s-&gt;l : generate(quizPrompt)
l.&gt;s : drafts or failure
s-&gt;p : parseRawQuestions(text)
p.&gt;s : usable raw drafts
s-&gt;c : buildQuestion(raw)
c.&gt;s : typed Question retaining its concept
--
s:If no valid questions remain, return failure without saving
s-&gt;r : saveQuiz(quiz)
r.&gt;s : saved or error
s.&gt;f : quiz with actual question count or error
f.&gt;u : quiz or error</panel_attributes>
